{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54517","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宫音姓，黄色（京本作「赤」）要先逢。\n青色气（京本作「云」）来军大败，更兼兵死将无功，黑气利先攻（京本作「锋」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54517.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54517","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}